  "description": "Production-grade Firebase Cloud Messaging (push notifications) for .NET: automatic batching over FCM's 500-token limit, dead-token reporting, topic broadcast, retry with backoff, explicit fail-open behaviour, and an optional built-in device-token store (generic-key, provider-neutral, self-migrating) that owns the FirebaseUserDevices table and prunes dead tokens for you.",
  "id": "AQZ.Firebase.Toolkit",
