  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.2.0: adds notification history. Sending to specific users now also records one inbox row per recipient in a new FirebaseUserNotifications table (opt-out via FirebaseStoreOptions.PersistNotifications). New INotificationStore<TKey> retrieves a user's notifications (paged, unread-only), unread count, and mark-read/mark-all-read. Requires a new EF migration for the added table. Non-breaking on the existing API.",
